  CORRECT (new): 2024-12-15 11:00:00 CET (UTC+0100)
  ⚠️  DIFFERENCE: 1.0 hour(s) off!

======================================================================
EXPLANATION OF THE BUG:
======================================================================

The buggy code used: BERLIN_TZ.localize(naive_utc_datetime)
  - This TREATS the datetime AS IF it's already in Berlin timezone
  - It doesn't CONVERT from UTC to Berlin

The correct code uses: UTC_TZ.localize(naive_dt).astimezone(BERLIN_TZ)
  - First makes the datetime UTC-aware
  - Then CONVERTS it to Berlin timezone

This bug caused a 1-hour offset, especially problematic during DST
transitions when the 2am-3am hour is skipped or repeated.
